id: E13539-draft-tank_you
trigger_tool: conan|target-runner|cpp
phase: target_validation|testing
error_signature: "No EXIF/TIFF data found|return code 0 without EXIF fields"
severity: 2
category: c++|stream-state|image-parser|testing
match_keywords: EXIF, JPEG, late marker, istream failbit, short read, seekg, content assertion
title: Chunked EXIF scanners must track marker discovery and reset stream state before seeking
root_cause: The scanner initialized its marker-found flag to true, so it stopped after the first buffer even when the marker was later in the file. A short final read also set failbit together with eofbit; clearing only eofbit left subsequent seekg in a failed state. The CLI still returned zero without EXIF output.
affected_scope: Legacy C++ image parsers that scan in fixed-size chunks then seek to TIFF or EXIF structures, especially when adapting command-line tools to OHOS.
verification_cmd: "Run the installed consumer CLI on TIFF, late-marker JPEG, short JPEG and buffer-split EXIF fixtures; assert exit status and parsed field content."
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: marker-state-and-seek-repair
rec_description: Initialize the found flag to false, set it only on a full marker match, preserve overlap across chunk boundaries, and clear stream state before seekg after a recoverable EOF. Keep genuine I/O errors distinguishable from expected short reads.
rec_command: "conan create <recipe> -pr:h=<ohos-profile> -pr:b=<ohos-profile> --build=<package>; inspect test_package output and installed binary assertions"
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: installed-cli-regression
fallback_description: If no upstream automated suite exists, add deterministic black-box fixtures and count only actual consumer test scenarios and assertions. Do not treat an exit code of zero as proof of parsed content.
fallback_command: "python3 test_metacam.py <installed metacam>"
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: manual
forbid_1_pattern: "successful-exit-only"
forbid_1_reason: The parser may return success while silently omitting all EXIF fields.
forbid_1_consequence: A broken package passes superficial CLI smoke tests.
forbid_2_pattern: "clear-eofbit-only-before-seek"
forbid_2_reason: A short std::istream::read can set failbit as well as eofbit.
forbid_2_consequence: A later seekg and TIFF parse are skipped despite locating the marker.
principles: P003, P007
causes: []
caused_by: []
similar_to: []
conflicts_with: []
prerequisite_of: []
